📂 Dataset Details


1. 📁 VCoR Dataset (Vehicle Color Recognition)
- Source: https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/landrykezebou/vcor-vehicle-color-recognition-dataset
- Contains car images categorized into different color folders (e.g., red, blue, white, etc.)
- Used to train the color classification model.

2. 📁 MS COCO Dataset (Optional - for person detection)
- Source: https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/rtatman/ms-coco
- Contains images with people and vehicle annotations.
- Used for additional testing of person detection (YOLO model was trained on this dataset).
